# Raw harness output. qa-meh2108-citysearch-occlusion.mjs writes PNG, and
# scripts/compress-qa-screenshots.mjs converts each one to the .webp committed
# beside it — so every PNG here is a duplicate of tracked evidence, regenerated
# on every re-run of the harness.
#
# They are ignored rather than deleted because the harness recreates them each
# run, and committing them is not merely untidy: the eight PNGs from one full
# before/after sweep total ~3.09 MB against the 2 MB "qa-artifacts size cap"
# required job (MEH-1156), so staging them reds a required gate.
#
# Scoped to this ticket's folder on purpose — two PNGs are tracked under
# qa-artifacts/ elsewhere in the repo, and silently changing that convention
# repo-wide is not this ticket's call.
*.png

# One-off diagnostics kept out of the evidence set: diag-* answered "why did the
# mobile map not mount" (it did — the probe was taking the hidden desktop shell),
# probe-* came from temporarily setting SAMPLES=10 to prove the constant controls
# the sample count. Neither is evidence for a finding.
diag-*
probe-*
